[en.DECISION_C01_C10_ANNEX]
Annex EEA

[en.DECISION_C01_C10_ANNEX_desc]
Cozy Glow appoints the Grand Chancellor Neighsay as the Minister of Education, thereby including the EEA under the EEME administration.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C10_ANNEX]
吞并教育协会

[zh.DECISION_C01_C10_ANNEX_desc]
和煦光流任命驹绝大会长为教育部部长，从而将教育协会纳入到小马利亚帝国教育部管辖下。
